@title Place each starter macro from the command field
@area Macros
# Ctrl+K, the macro's whole name, Enter chooses it, the Place button puts it on the page.
# The pictures show the routing: every wire is horizontal or vertical.
fresh
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "Motor starter DOL"
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
shot 01-picked
click_text Place #2
wait 20
shot 01-placed
